        }
      ],
      "updated": 1786240351464,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Pengisian form:\n1. Email address wajib di isi.\n2. domain wajib di isi.\n3. subdomain wajib hanya di prod stage.\n4. Deliverability Enhancements wajib enable.\n5. Dedicated IP Pool, perlu kalau shared IP sudah rusak reputasinya.\n6. Tenant Management, perlu ketika kita ingin menambahkan kirim dan terima email\ndari app kita.",
      "fontSize": 40.63277463132386,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Pengisian form:\n1. Email address wajib di isi.\n2. domain wajib di isi.\n3. subdomain wajib hanya di prod stage.\n4. Deliverability Enhancements wajib enable.\n5. Dedicated IP Pool, perlu kalau shared IP sudah rusak reputasinya.\n6. Tenant Management, perlu ketika kita ingin menambahkan kirim dan terima email\ndari app kita.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
